DESCRIPTION:Bright Nights by ANZ transforms the Brisbane River into a dazzl
 ing\, choreographed canvas of water\, light\, and sound. Floating fountain
 s\, waterscreens\, amazing animated water features and water jets shooting
  up to 80 meters high\, all pierced by a stunning laser light show\, this 
 bold installation fills the Festival Village precinct with colour\, energy
  and emotion.
